sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant A as lowpriv
  participant CA as ADESC-Root-CA
  participant DC as KDC
  Note over A,CA: Step 1 — get an Enrollment Agent certificate
  A->>CA: req -template ESC3-CRA (EKU = Certificate Request Agent)
  CA-->>A: Agent certificate (agent.pfx)
  Note over A,CA: Step 2 — use the agent cert to enroll ON BEHALF OF admin
  A->>CA: req -template ESC3-Enroll -on-behalf-of ADESCRTL\administrator -pfx agent.pfx
  CA->>CA: Validates RA signature (agent EKU) then builds subject from admin AD account
  CA-->>A: Client-auth certificate for administrator
  A->>DC: PKINIT -> TGT as administrator
